  <!-- EN: Autumn Blade is a criminal arms dealing syndicate.  Built from the ashes of Yakuza treachery this organization has grown from a small street operation to an interplanetary business, Autumn Blade works alongside, but is not affiliated with, the Yakuza, the Tongs, and the Triads. -->
  <AutumnBlade.description>“秋之刃”是一个犯罪军火贩卖集团。该组织在“雅库扎”背叛的废墟上崛起，已从一个小型街头团伙发展成为跨星际企业。“秋之刃”虽与“雅库扎”、“堂”及“三合会”合作，但并不隶属于这些组织。</AutumnBlade.description>
