  <!-- EN: nomad -->
  <Tribe.label>游牧民</Tribe.label>
  <!-- EN: Nomads were once corporate wage-slaves, who got fired and blackballed from employment, and now they roam the roads and live in their own villages. As life on the road is hard, they maintain strong family bonds. If a Nomad is in trouble, he can count on members of his family to watch his back. -->
  <Tribe.description>游牧民曾是企业的“工资奴隶”，后来被解雇并遭到就业封杀，如今他们游走于道路之间，生活在自己的村落里。由于流浪生活艰辛，他们维系着紧密的家庭纽带。如果游牧民遇到麻烦，他可以指望家人为他保驾护航。</Tribe.description>
